# Browser
# Draw replacements played by Bot1's page. Bot1 makes itself discard Golgari Grave-Troll with Thoughtseize. Golgari Grave-Troll's dredge and Chains of Mephistopheles both replace Ancestral
# Recall's first draw, and the page asks which applies first, saying the event is a card Bot1 would draw (CR 616.1, 121.6);
# Bot1 takes the dredge, and the page asks in dredge's words whether to mill six and return the Troll instead (CR 702.52a).
# Bot1 dredges; the second draw meets Chains alone (the Troll is in hand) - Bot1 discards the Troll and the draw that follows
# is dredged again; the third the same, declined, and drawn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Chains of Mephistopheles
Thoughtseize
Ancestral Recall
Golgari Grave-Troll
Forest x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Chains of Mephistopheles.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Thoughtseize.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Choose(Golgari Grave-Troll)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = You would draw a card: which applies first?
Bot1.Replace(Golgari Grave-Troll)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Golgari Grave-Troll)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Golgari Grave-Troll)
Bot1.Decline
